### ============================================================
### 34-SpringCloudOpenFeign API Testing (Port: 8134)
### ============================================================

### 1. Gọi danh sách sản phẩm qua Feign Client
GET http://localhost:8134/api/products?limit=10
Accept: application/json

### 2. Gọi chi tiết sản phẩm theo ID (Feign Client gắn kèm Bearer Token qua RequestInterceptor)
GET http://localhost:8134/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer mock-token-abc
Accept: application/json

### 3. Tạo sản phẩm mới
POST http://localhost:8134/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": null,
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "price": 129.99
}

### 4. Test Error Decoder (Gọi ID 999 trả về 404 -> Custom Error Decoder xử lý)
GET http://localhost:8134/api/products/999
Accept: application/json
